WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:03.927
Unit five. Emergency Numbers and First Aid!

2
00:00:04.876 --> 00:00:08.699
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.749 --> 00:00:12.294
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:16.933
Today we learn about Emergency Numbers and First Aid. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.626 --> 00:00:22.192
Emergency number. Say it with me. Emergency number!

6
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.809
CPR. Say it with me. CPR!

7
00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:37.763
Recovery position. Say it with me. Recovery position!

8
00:00:41.248 --> 00:00:45.465
First responder. Say it with me. First responder!

9
00:00:48.971 --> 00:00:52.488
Choking. Say it with me. Choking!

10
00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:59.239
Burn. Say it with me. Burn!

11
00:01:02.738 --> 00:01:06.222
Sprain. Say it with me. Sprain!

12
00:01:09.732 --> 00:01:14.549
Emergency plan. Say it with me. Emergency plan!

13
00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:31.866
Knowing the emergency number in my country could save a life. Basic CPR and the recovery position help someone who is hurt until a first responder arrives. Every family should have an emergency plan for a burn, sprain, or choking.

14
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:33.180
I can do that too!

15
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:39.858
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.908 --> 00:01:41.538
Recovery position!

17
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:47.849
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.049
Sprain!

19
00:01:49.940 --> 00:02:02.745
Did you know? In Cambodia, you can call 119 for an ambulance, 117 for the police and 118 for the fire service. Calling quickly can make a big difference!

20
00:02:02.795 --> 00:02:05.455
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.606 --> 00:02:14.595
Think and answer. Why is it important to know basic first aid?

22
00:02:14.645 --> 00:02:15.795
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.925 --> 00:02:21.628
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.678 --> 00:02:24.238
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

